# Local dev: usually you don't need this file. The API base URL is
# selected in code (see web/lib/api.ts):
#   - dev (`npm run dev`)   -> http://127.0.0.1:8000
#   - production build      -> "" (relative /api/... same-origin)
#
# Copy to .env.local ONLY if you need to override — for example, if your
# FastAPI runs on a non-default port, or you want to test against a
# remote backend.
#
# IMPORTANT: any value set here gets loaded into BOTH dev and production
# builds (with higher precedence than .env.production). Don't put a
# localhost URL here if you ever run `npm run build` for deploy — the
# user's browser would then try to fetch your localhost, not the
# server's. To override only for production, use .env.production.local.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
